# Habits from Rust (docs/design/agents.md 1.5, compiler/habits.azl): each is answered with an
# error that names the habit and says the azoL form, and with the edit when it is mechanical.
==== E0121: `let mut x = 1`
---- file a.azl
fn main() {
    let mut x = 1
    x = 2
    print(x)
}
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 1
---- reports E0121 2:9
---- apply-fix
---- after-has a.azl
    var x = 1
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 0
